msgid "Planning a promotion, and one post won’t cut it? Simply tell the AI what the series is about, the number of posts, frequency, and schedule. The AI will generate your entire series in seconds. Review, tweak if needed, and your posts will be published automatically as scheduled."
msgstr "Plánujete propagáciu a jeden príspevok nestačí? Jednoducho povedzte AI, o čom je séria, počet príspevkov, frekvenciu a harmonogram. AI vygeneruje celú vašu sériu za sekundy. Skontrolujte, upravte, ak je to potrebné, a vaše príspevky budú automaticky publikované podľa plánu."

msgid "Make it easy for customers to leave reviews."
msgstr "Uľahčite zákazníkom zanechávanie recenzií."

msgid "Encourage more customers to leave feedback by sending review requests via email or offering printed QR materials for easy scanning at your location."
